#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates learning a noise model for a unitary gate with a "
"standard learning protocol accessible through the high-level protocol "
"functions "
"[`prepare_vanilla_program()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-"
"learning/generated/protocols-prepare-vanilla-"
"program#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program "
"\"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program\") and "
"[`process_vanilla_result()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-"
"learning/generated/protocols-process-vanilla-"
"result#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result "
"\"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result\").\n"
msgstr ""

